WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 9:18-62 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2610), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-10-28.

1
00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.050
About eight days after Jesus said this,

2
00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:09.550
he took Peter, John and James with him

3
00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.800
and went up onto a mountain to pray.

4
00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:18.400
As he was praying, the appearance of his face changed,

5
00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:21.850
and his clothes became as bright as a flash of lightning.

6
00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:32.700
Two men, Moses and Elijah,

7
00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:36.200
appeared in glorious splendor, talking with Jesus.

8
00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:38.800
They spoke about his departure,

9
00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:42.200
which he was about to bring to fulfillment at Jerusalem.

10
00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.250
Peter and his companions were very sleepy,

11
00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.140
but when they became fully awake,

12
00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:52.300
they saw his glory and the two men standing with him.

13
00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:57.000
As the men were leaving Jesus, Peter said to him,

14
00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.700
Master, it is good for us to be here.

15
00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.050
Let us put up three shelters,

16
00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:06.050
one for you, one for Moses and one for Elijah.

17
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.400
He did not know what he was saying.

18
00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:12.250
While he was speaking, a cloud appeared and covered them,

19
00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:15.050
and they were afraid as they entered the cloud.

20
00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:17.750
A voice came from the cloud, saying,

21
00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:21.650
This is my Son, whom I have chosen;

22
00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:26.000
listen to him.

23
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.800
When the voice had spoken, they found that Jesus was alone.

24
00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.650
The disciples kept this to themselves

25
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.200
and did not tell anyone at that time what they had seen.
